            {
                "entry_id": "5ca812f7-3dc5-38cc-bdf5-401ba5da0084",
                "word": "Vétérane",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ac83e9f3-f18f-35db-befd-b2a61488be92",
                        "entry_id": "5ca812f7-3dc5-38cc-bdf5-401ba5da0084",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Prénom d’une prêtresse romaine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "02accbeb-a436-4e88-820d-4d4adbb5e040",
                                "sense_id": "ac83e9f3-f18f-35db-befd-b2a61488be92",
                                "text": "Mais la prêtresse Vétérane, ayant rempli sa sainte carrière, abandonne les foyers près desquels se consuma sa jeunesse."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "15618846-1e11-3cd9-ae31-7a2603af1b39",
                "word": "vétérane",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "9e783be3-025f-4791-84a5-a8b30c57bd12",
                        "entry_id": "15618846-1e11-3cd9-ae31-7a2603af1b39",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "vétéranes"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "77a4e74f-46b5-418b-bc38-75223333fbe7",
                        "entry_id": "15618846-1e11-3cd9-ae31-7a2603af1b39",
                        "tags": [
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "form": "vétéran"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fe574422-ae21-3a76-a6ba-e7f0c4c7226c",
                        "entry_id": "15618846-1e11-3cd9-ae31-7a2603af1b39",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Femme âgée, ancienne, vieillarde, vieille."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2df6ab86-23f6-4b8f-9650-5a4c19d060df",
                                "sense_id": "fe574422-ae21-3a76-a6ba-e7f0c4c7226c",
                                "text": "Les qualifications les plus relevées étaient trouvées facilement par ces vétéranes : chien, fils de chien, arrière-petit-fils de chien, bandit, voleur, assassin, pillard, et bien d’autres épithètes que la langue française ne supporterait pas, et surtout ces dernières, sortaient brûlantes de la bouche de ces guerrières."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5a700f1d-0bd9-361b-bdc3-904ac23c53f4",
                        "entry_id": "15618846-1e11-3cd9-ae31-7a2603af1b39",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Femme ayant acquis, au fil des ans, savoir et expérience : connaisseuse, experte, spécialiste."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9286f58a-a1c5-4677-b383-97de8223b189",
                                "sense_id": "5a700f1d-0bd9-361b-bdc3-904ac23c53f4",
                                "text": "Monseigneur, qui haïssait la musique française, et surtout les pédants, mit M. Criardet à la porte, lava la tête au président, lui soutint que mon chant était fait pour plaire partout ailleurs que dans une ville barbare, digne patrie de l’ignorance et du mauvais goût, et conclut en assurant qu’il ne souffrirait pas que je débutasse au concert, dût-il payer le dédit de mon engagement, ou faire venir à ses frais, pour me remplacer, quelque vétérane des chœurs de l’Opéra."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8d42edc-82f0-4832-a64c-24c83b7b9f04",
                                "sense_id": "5a700f1d-0bd9-361b-bdc3-904ac23c53f4",
                                "text": "Vétérane du milieu militant et hackeuse en faveur des libertés numériques, Shari Steele a pris la direction du TOR Project, l’organisation derrière The Onion Router (TOR – « le routeur oignon »), le réseau d’anonymisation, a annoncé le groupe vendredi 11 décembre dans un communiqué."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fdb6aa10-e954-349f-a286-8caf3b2088c8",
                        "entry_id": "15618846-1e11-3cd9-ae31-7a2603af1b39",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ancienne soldate."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3dd1ee51-cde4-4ce2-a0e8-17a942ce8eae",
                                "sense_id": "fdb6aa10-e954-349f-a286-8caf3b2088c8",
                                "text": "Il a choisi la vétérane Shawn Skelly, une femme trans, dans l’équipe du ministère de la Défense."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "60369d5e-f7ae-3d0f-bc6c-db80861d763c",
                        "entry_id": "15618846-1e11-3cd9-ae31-7a2603af1b39",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sportive engagée dans une compétition après un âge qui peut varier selon les sports (après 35 ans ou 45 ans)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc63f6d0-395a-4322-877a-2d63ffabe9f4",
                                "sense_id": "60369d5e-f7ae-3d0f-bc6c-db80861d763c",
                                "text": "Elles s’en doutaient bien : réitérer l’exploit de l’an passé à Laval (doublé en vétéranes, 4ᵉ et 8ᵉ du scratch) serait plus que difficile."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16016e78-e563-4301-8c8b-d9e48449a13f",
                                "sense_id": "60369d5e-f7ae-3d0f-bc6c-db80861d763c",
                                "text": "La valeur ne s’efface pas avec les années. Mais Andréa Dragoman ne laissa pas la moindre chance à Agnès Le Lannic : trop vite, trop fort pour la vétérane lyssoise."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e6524b9-d7e2-45f6-80b2-29192f77c665",
                                "sense_id": "60369d5e-f7ae-3d0f-bc6c-db80861d763c",
                                "text": "La vétérane est abondamment utilisée par son entraîneuse Kori Cheverie, et avec le départ de Barnes, il semble que la brigade montréalaise ne tienne plus qu’à un fil."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f6e7515a-3408-416e-9fe8-50aeb64f014e",
                        "source_entry_id": "15618846-1e11-3cd9-ae31-7a2603af1b39",
                        "source_sense_id": "5a700f1d-0bd9-361b-bdc3-904ac23c53f4",
                        "source_sense_description": "Femme ayant savoir et expérience",
                        "target_lang_word": "Veteranin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Veteranin",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "816ef12b-ebc3-3b7b-82f4-bf9254705279",
                                        "entry_id": "c54f18f2-e96f-3c3b-9ec7-93386ca5bd65",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "altgediente, erfahrene, weibliche Person"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d08d2f6f-b055-4a86-bb86-969f30b749a9",
                                                "sense_id": "816ef12b-ebc3-3b7b-82f4-bf9254705279",
                                                "text": "Beim Treffen der Veteraninnen wurden alte Bekanntschaften aufgefrischt."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "daeba170-c8f3-4f56-a571-6c240e5acec9",
                        "source_entry_id": "15618846-1e11-3cd9-ae31-7a2603af1b39",
                        "source_sense_id": "5a700f1d-0bd9-361b-bdc3-904ac23c53f4",
                        "source_sense_description": "Femme ayant savoir et expérience",
                        "target_lang_word": "veteran",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "veteran",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ca68d47-b168-3ed3-9c94-6b040ded7b1a",
                                        "entry_id": "896a8f2b-2614-3d17-9da2-a731b8271d09",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with long experience of a particular activity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dd6962c-f0ea-4e8c-a4ac-44b6ad018011",
                                                "sense_id": "3ca68d47-b168-3ed3-9c94-6b040ded7b1a",
                                                "text": "The company's new hires were nervous, but the veterans were self-assured because, as one summarized it, \"this isn't our first rodeo.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a2736c9-54a8-4a25-892f-5c1c7936e758",
                                                "sense_id": "3ca68d47-b168-3ed3-9c94-6b040ded7b1a",
                                                "text": "Private-equity nabobs bristle at being dubbed mere financiers.[…]Much of their pleading is public-relations bluster. Clever financial ploys are what have made billionaires of the industry’s veterans. “Operational improvement” in a portfolio company has often meant little more than promising colossal bonuses to sitting chief executives if they meet ambitious growth targets. That model is still prevalent today."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7aeb4480-a7ad-311c-b771-76a2561edae5",
                                        "entry_id": "896a8f2b-2614-3d17-9da2-a731b8271d09",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with long experience of a particular activity.",
                                            "A person who has served in the armed forces, especially an old soldier who has seen long service."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f708683-247f-4db5-bdc9-78239314f0f1",
                                                "sense_id": "7aeb4480-a7ad-311c-b771-76a2561edae5",
                                                "text": "We honor veterans and senior citizens with a ten percent discount."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0d99cc0-99fe-4379-85ae-e360bf4b170d",
                                                "sense_id": "7aeb4480-a7ad-311c-b771-76a2561edae5",
                                                "text": "For 55-year-old U.S. Army veteran Sae Joon Park, this was the hardest moment of his life. […] Park's story reflects both the challenges of life after combat and the perils that noncitizen veterans face if caught in the legal system — realities made harsher amid the Trump administration's push for record deportations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fea74acb-5e0d-38b0-b2da-4a27f012af9a",
                                        "entry_id": "896a8f2b-2614-3d17-9da2-a731b8271d09",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group, animal, etc. with long experience of a particular activity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f867a91e-bce5-496a-bae1-0cb2a8cded27",
                                                "sense_id": "fea74acb-5e0d-38b0-b2da-4a27f012af9a",
                                                "text": "Their mules were clearly veterans. They seemed to know what to do even better than the teenage farmhand who was driving the team."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b55569c-2460-4df0-8efe-134b6df4f047",
                                                "sense_id": "fea74acb-5e0d-38b0-b2da-4a27f012af9a",
                                                "text": "Most of the cars which we call \"veterans\" today were on view at the Motor Show of 1911."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c558e9e9-443f-4bf0-8935-ce307e09159c",
                                                "sense_id": "fea74acb-5e0d-38b0-b2da-4a27f012af9a",
                                                "text": "The label has often collaborated with other designers, like Australian shoemaker Teva and American woolwear veteran Pendleton."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "veteran",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d43969b2-6081-3a4a-9bd8-5b9452dc51f6",
                                        "entry_id": "54378025-2dee-36e6-8d79-8ea40b075fef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having had long experience, practice, or service."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fcc55e5-c433-4046-a321-fadde51c31b8",
                                                "sense_id": "d43969b2-6081-3a4a-9bd8-5b9452dc51f6",
                                                "text": "The insinuating eloquence and delicate flattery of veteran diplomatists and courtiers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6504b35c-8de6-4053-ab5a-ca512f2c70ae",
                                                "sense_id": "d43969b2-6081-3a4a-9bd8-5b9452dc51f6",
                                                "text": "Nothing could be more business-like than the construction of the stout dams, and nothing more gently rural than the limpid lakes, with the grand old forest trees marshalled round their margins like a veteran army that had marched down to drink, only to be stricken motionless at the water’s edge."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b216132-a0ef-44b8-b50f-f41d665d5a28",
                                                "sense_id": "d43969b2-6081-3a4a-9bd8-5b9452dc51f6",
                                                "text": "“That was in Casco,” his wife contradicted immediately. She spoke in the unmistakable tones of a veteran contradictor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0dcd539c-3b77-354e-9ef5-4340680f78ac",
                                        "entry_id": "54378025-2dee-36e6-8d79-8ea40b075fef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to former members of the military armed forces, especially those who served during wartime."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
